== Effects ==
* Grants [[flight]] for the duration of the room.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc+|r}} During the chase sequence following {{i|Knife Piece 2}}, XII - The Hanged Man may appear behind puzzle element and if reached, allows Isaac to skip an entire room by flying out of it.{{dlc-}}

== Strategy ==
* Flight can halve the cost of entering a {{r|Curse Room}}: entering a curse room while flying will not deal any damage. Exiting a curse room by its door will deal damage to Isaac in all cases.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth}}: No effect.

